<title>PHILIPPINES: Negros Navigation Q3 net 75.052 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Negros Navigation Q3 net 75.052 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Negros Navigation Co said on Wednesday it posted a net income of 75.052 million pesos during the third quarter of the year.</p>
<p>Revenues reached 1.033 billion pesos in the same period, it said.</p>
<p>Comparative figures were not immediately available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
